msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "Would you like to adjust REAPER preferences for optimal compatibility with screen readers? Choosing yes will make the following changes:"
msgstr "您想调整 REAPER 首选项以实现读屏的最佳兼容性吗？选择是将进行以下更改:"

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "1. Undock the Media Explorer so that it gets focus when opened."
msgstr "1. 取消停靠媒体资源管理器,确保打开时自动获得焦点."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "2. Enable closing Media Explorer using the escape key."
msgstr "2. 启用 ESC 键 关闭媒体资源管理器."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "3. Enable legacy file browse dialogs, so that REAPER specific options in the Open and Save As dialogs can be reached with the tab key."
msgstr "3. 启用旧版文件浏览对话框,以便能用 tab 键切换到打开和另存为对话框中的 REAPER 特定选项."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "4. Enable the space key to be used for check boxes and buttons in various windows, wherever that's more convenient than space playing the project."
msgstr "4. 允许在各个窗口中使用空格键操作复选框和按钮,以免空格键直接播放工程而带来不便."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "5. Show text labels to indicate parallel, offline and bypassed in the FX list."
msgstr "5. 在FX列表中显示并行,离线和旁路状态的文本标签."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "6. Use a standard, accessible edit control for the video code editor."
msgstr "6. 为视频代码编辑器使用标准的,无障碍的编辑控件."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "7. Hide type prefixes in the FX browser so that browsing through FX is more efficient."
msgstr "7.  在FX 浏览器中隐藏类型前缀,以便更高效的浏览 FX."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "8. Disable snap to visible grid in the MIDI Editor so movement by grid is not dependent on the horizontal zoom setting."
msgstr "8.  在 MIDI 编辑器中禁用吸附到网格,以便网格移动不依赖于水平缩放设置."

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "9. Make Control+Space play/stop when keyboard focus is in dialogs, needed with REAPER 7.41 or newer."
msgstr "9.  当键盘焦点在对话框中时,使 Control+Space 执行播放/停止,REAPER 7.41 或更高版本需要此设置。"

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "10. Display the file name and then the full path in the Recent Projects menu."
msgstr "\t10. 在最近使用的工程菜单中显示文件名和完整路径"

msgctxt "optimal REAPER configuration"
msgid "Note: if now isn't a good time to tweak REAPER, you can apply these adjustments later by going to the Extensions menu in the menu bar and then the OSARA submenu."
msgstr "注: 若当前不想调整 REAPER 设置,后续仍可通过菜单栏\"扩展\"菜单中的\"OSARA\"子菜单进行配置."

